# R8 keep rules for the release build (T7.4 trial). AGP combines every file in src/main/keepRules with the
# consumer rules that each library ships (kotlinx.serialization, Room, DataStore, Compose, lifecycle, coroutines).
#
# Every rule here is justified in docs/RELEASE_RUNBOOK.md, section "R8 trial"; do not add speculative keeps.

# Readable crash traces in Play Console / retrace: keep file names and line numbers, hide the real file name.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
-renamesourcefileattribute SourceFile
